pan><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-seven-tuple-tm</span><span>73-definition-7.1</span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§8.2, print pp. 324–336; PDF pp. 346–358; local normalized interface unless explicitly BookTM"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_numbering","html":"local-catalog; not book numbering"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§7.2–7.3 and §7.5, pp. 148–152, 159–166; local normalized model, not literal book tuple"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-normalized-machine-model; compare explicit book-model atoms"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"8"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqcup\">\\(\\sqcup\\)</span> 是本接口固定的空白字符，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sqcup\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\">\\(\\sqcup\\notin\\Sigma\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\mathsf L\">\\(L=\\mathsf L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\mathsf R\">\\(R=\\mathsf R\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a63442026b2f1a9a\" href=\"?note=a63442026b2f1a9a\" title=\"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm\">73-df-eight-tuple-dtm</a> 的两个方向。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\)</span> 为候选七元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lift}_7\">\\(\\operatorname{lift}_7\\)</span> 是下述插入固定空白字符的映射。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.1}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\n\\coloneqq(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\sqcup,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.1}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\n\\coloneqq(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\sqcup,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.1}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(M)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(\\pi_1(M),\\pi_2(M),\\pi_3(M),\\pi_4(M),\\pi_5(M),\\pi_6(M),\\pi_7(M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.1}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(M)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(\\pi_1(M),\\pi_2(M),\\pi_3(M),\\pi_4(M),\\pi_5(M),\\pi_6(M),\\pi_7(M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\n\\{(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}):\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}7.1}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\n\\{(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}}):\n\\operatorname{lift}_7(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\Sigma}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是旧目录的两终态七元组接口，空白字符作为环境参数；它不等于原书的 (Q,Σ,Γ,δ,q₀,B,F)。原书结构已补在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d46ee2f661474682\" href=\"?note=d46ee2f661474682\" title=\"73-df-book-tm-structure\">73-df-book-tm-structure</a>。此接口插入空白分量后与本地八元组逐步对应；与原书模型的比较须经过另立的模型翻译。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-book-tm-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d46ee2f661474682","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-book-tm-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm","status":"resolved","id":"a63442026b2f1a9a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；有限词、单字符词和拼接见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm","status":"resolved","id":"a63442026b2f1a9a","anchor":"ref-5","ta